DarkCave_Cave1_Text_BlackBelt_1::
	.string "Huh?, what are you doing in this\n"
	.string "cave, kid?\p"
	.string "Are you not afraid of dark?\p"
	.string "Hehe... I like your style, kid!\n"
	.string "Why don’t we have a battle?\p"
	.string "If you win, I’ll give you a nice\n"
	.string "gift, what do you say?$"

DarkCave_Cave1_Text_BlackBelt_2::
	.string "OK, but if you change your mind,\n"
	.string "I’ll be here!$"

DarkCave_Cave1_Text_BlackBelt_3::
	.string "Till we meet again, kid,\n"
	.string "hehe...$"

DarkCave_Cave1_Text_BlackBeltDefeat::
	.string "Hehe... I lost to you!$"

DarkCave_Cave1_Text_BlackBeltVictory::
	.string "Hehe... You lose...$"

DarkCave_Cave1_Text_BlackBelt_4::
	.string "As I promised, here’s your gift!$"

DarkCave_Cave1_Text_BlackBelt_5::
	.string "That’s ROLLOUT!, it’s a rock-type\n"
	.string "move that increases its strength\l"
	.string "the more it hits!$"
